    {
      "name": "I2C_MIN_PCLK_FREQ",
      "sig": "#define I2C_MIN_PCLK_FREQ(__PCLK__, __SPEED__)             (((__SPEED__) <= 100000U) ? ((__PCLK__) < I2C_MIN_PCLK_FREQ_STANDARD) : ((__PCLK__) < I2C_MIN_PCLK_FREQ_FAST))",
      "brief": "判断外设时钟频率是否低于指定速率所需的最小值: 标准模式(≤100kHz)为 2MHz, 快速模式为 4MHz, 低于则返回 1。",
